/	THE CODE ON THE NEXT FOUR PAGES IS ONCE-ONLY.

/	THE REST OF THE RESIDENT CODE NORMALLY FOUND IN THE NEXT FOUR PAGES
/	WILL BE LOADED BY STILL FURTHER ONCE-ONLY CODE AFTER POSSIBLY USING
