	CLA			/THROW IT AWAY
NEWT1,	TEOS			/ANY EXTRANEOUS GARBAGE ON LINE
	JMP	NEWTHRW		/YES
EAEZAP,	TAD	LOCNTR		/**** NO EAE **** SKP
	MQL			/PUT BACK INTO MQ
	JMS I	PRTBUF/[XPRTBF]	/GO PRINT LINE BUFFER
	TAD	LSTSW		/IS LISTING ALLOWED?
