	JMP	THROCOMMENT	/ELSE TOSS IT
	JMP	EAEZAP		/CONTINUE THERE

/	DOLLAR "$" END OF ASSEMBLY HANDLER.

DOLLAR,	DCA	NWSTZP		/PREVENT FURTHER INPUT

/	COMMENT "/" PROCESSOR.

COMMNT,	JMS I	GCH/[XGCH]	/GET NEXT CHARACTER
OSYSIO,	SZA CLA			/<EOL>?
