CHBUF,	SOURCE				/**** OPTIONS **** UPDATED BY PAGES
CHFUN,	SBOOT-SOURCE-400+400%2		/UNIT FILLED IN; PAGE COUNT DETERMINED BY OPTIONS
CHBLK,	40				/BLOCK ARGUMENT
