REPLACE,-3/.-.			/REPLACE ROUTINE; INITIALIZED FOR OPTION SWITCH XOR
	DCA	SXR		/SAVE PASSED POINTER
	TAD I	SXR		/GET A VALUE
	SNA			/END OF LIST?
	JMP I	REPLACE		/YES, RETURN
	DCA	TMP		/NO, SAVE AS ADDRESS
