	TAD I	ORSYM/[XORSYM]		/GET OLD PUTWD ARGUMENT
	DCA	TPE2			/SAVE IF NECESSARY
	JMS I	PDUMPC			/NOW DUMP OUT THE LITERALS
	TAD	OFPLIT/(JMS	TESTPE)	/RESET TESTPE CALL
	DCA	LT2ZAP			/FOR FUTURE USE
