	JMP	.-5		/NO, GO BACK
BLFIXCM,TAD	BLFXLEN/(-24-1)	/SETUP
	DCA I	PSTTLEN/(STTLEN)/NEW LENGTH
	DCA I	PPAGNUM/(PAGNUM)/START ON PAGE S-1
